	quest.6AC320983C7ADF17.quest_desc: [
		"Someone said you can find a &6block of peat&r in &bwater&r bodies if you make a block out of the digged up &6peat&r and smelt it you get fuel for the peat generator. If it is useful in the state we´re already in, I honestly don´t know. "
